# Potion of Luck (daily reward OutMindLink : potion base LUCK nommee "§d§lPotion of Luck") :
# la fiole vide rendue apres l'avoir bue disparait de l'inventaire (2026-09-02).
on consume:
    if event-item is a potion:
        if name of event-item contains "Potion of Luck":
            wait 1 tick
            remove 1 glass bottle from player's inventory
